# Example drop-in: start client services after lemnosd has built the board's devices.
# The main unit names no clients, because the board's clients belong to the image.
#
# Install as /etc/systemd/system/lemnosd.service.d/order.conf (or with
# `systemctl edit lemnosd`), and list the units that use lemnosd's devices:
#
#   [Unit]
#   Before=<client-unit>.service <other-client-unit>.service
#
# A client that talks to lemnosd also wants `Wants=lemnosd.service` (or
# `Requires=`) so it starts the service when it is not running yet.
